  m_text: 'The LAPSSIM project was guided under the supervision of <b><color=#00C3FF>Dr.
    Altaf Hussain</color></b>, with highly valuable co-supervision and continuous
    project support provided by <b><color=#00FF47>Mr. Kaleemullah Khan</color></b>,
    whose guidance greatly strengthened the overall development process. Essential
    medical insights and surgical accuracy were ensured through the expertise of
    <b><color=#FFDD00>Dr. Mashood Khan</color></b>. The simulator was developed by
    <b><color=#FF9A00>Muhammad Ahmad Mobeen</color></b>, while the 3D environments
    and models were creatively designed by <b><color=#FF57F7>Areeba Saeed</color></b>
    and <b><color=#FF57F7>Amna Ashfaq</color></b>, whose artistic contributions brought
    the virtual training experience to life.

'
