  m_text: "\u2022 Use the W, S, A, and D keys to move Forward, Backward, Left, and
    Right respectively.\n\u2022 Press X to show or hide the main menu during gameplay.\n\u2022
    Press TAB to toggle between single-hand control mode and free movement mode within
    the scene.\n\u2022 Press \\ to hide or show the cursor while in play mode.\n\u2022
    Press G to grab an object and R to rotate the selected object.\n\u2022 Press
    T and Y to switch between the left and right hand controllers.\n\u2022 Press
    E to move upward and Q to move downward within the environment.\n\u2022 Press
    ESC to disable all gameplay control keys during play mode.\n\u2022 Press CTRL
    + X to close the currently active panel."
